OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain across southern
OL,7,Fparts, while conditions remain clearer
OL,8,Fand drier further north, where there
OL,9,Fis an increased risk of frost and ice
OL,10,Fforming on untreated surfaces. Feeling
OL,11,Fchilly across the north, more mild
OL,12,Facross the south.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA frosty start, with clear
OL,15,Fskies across northern parts, while
OL,16,Fconditions remain cloudier across the
OL,17,Fsouth. Any remaining cloud will clear
OL,18,Fby late morning, bringing prolonged
OL,19,Fsunshine to most places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
